- Yes.

199
00:16:55,399 --> 00:16:55,960
- Vincent.
- Yes.

200
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:56,799
Yes.

201
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:57,440
- Vincent.
- Yes.

202
00:16:57,559 --> 00:16:57,960
Yes.

203
