212
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:15,640
No.

213
00:17:16,839 --> 00:17:17,359
No.

214
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:18,519
No.

215
00:17:19,119 --> 00:17:19,720
No.

216
00:17:20,079 --> 00:17:20,880
- That's it.
- No.

217
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:21,960
No. No.

218
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:22,440
Vincent.

219
00:17:22,559 --> 00:17:22,960
No.

220
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,400
No. No.

221
00:17:24,599 --> 00:17:25,519
- Vincent.
- No.

222
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:26,359
No.

223
00:17:26,559 --> 00:17:27,440
- Not true.
- No.

224
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:28,319
No.

225
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:29,839
- Vincent, listen.
- No. No.

226
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:30,799
- Vincent.
- No. No.

227
00:17:30,839 --> 00:17:31,599
No, no!

228
00:17:31,599 --> 00:17:33,000
- Vincent, listen.
- No.

229
00:17:33,279 --> 00:17:33,839
Vincent.

230
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:35,119
Easy, Vincent.

231
00:17:35,799 --> 00:17:36,720
Easy. Vincent.

232
00:17:37,279 --> 00:17:37,720
Easy.

233
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:39,119
Easy.

234
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:41,599
Listen to me.

235
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,200
I don't want

236
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:45,880
