261
00:18:37,600 --> 00:18:42,600
♪Who can hear♪

262
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,720
♪It?♪

263
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:47,240
Jiang Ting.

264
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:52,119
Did you find out something about Su Lin?

265
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:55,640
Not yet.

266
00:18:58,839 --> 00:19:00,160
