293
00:19:52,720 --> 00:19:53,400
Su Lin did.

294
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:55,359
She fought for it.

295
00:19:57,720 --> 00:19:58,200
So

296
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:00,079
