299
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:07,960
Just because she crossed Ma Na?

300
00:20:14,839 --> 00:20:16,440
Actually, I found something.

301
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:18,920
It might be a clue to finding Su Lin.

302
00:20:19,119 --> 00:20:19,799
What is it?

303
00:20:21,759 --> 00:20:23,599
But I don't know if I'm right.

304
00:20:24,839 --> 00:20:26,440
I haven't dared tell anyone.

305
00:20:27,079 --> 00:20:27,799
But at least,

306
00:20:29,599 --> 00:20:30,880
I know you genuinely care

307
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:31,839
about Su Lin.

308
00:20:32,839 --> 00:20:33,440
Don't worry.

309
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:36,359
You can trust me.

310
00:20:37,559 --> 00:20:38,440
We'll work together

311
00:20:38,799 --> 00:20:39,559
and find Su Lin.

312
00:20:45,319 --> 00:20:45,960
Jiang Ting.

313
00:20:48,880 --> 00:20:49,559
Ma Na.

314
00:20:50,839 --> 00:20:51,559
Why are you here?

315
00:20:53,119 --> 00:20:54,039
I'm asking you.

316
00:20:58,240 --> 00:20:59,720
You won't go abroad because of her?

317
00:20:59,960 --> 00:21:00,759
What're you saying?

318
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:01,720
Am I wrong?

319
00:21:01,759 --> 00:21:02,759
What're you two doing?

320
00:21:02,759 --> 00:21:03,559
Let go of me!

321
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:05,359
Song Shuang!

322
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:06,279
- Let go!
- Let go!

323
00:21:06,319 --> 00:21:07,240
- Don't move!
- Let go!

324
00:21:07,359 --> 00:21:08,400
What did you tell him?

325
00:21:08,440 --> 00:21:09,000
Ma Na!

326
00:21:09,039 --> 00:21:09,839
Not your business.

327
00:21:09,880 --> 00:21:10,440
Ma Na!

328
00:21:10,559 --> 00:21:11,799
You know what you've done.

329
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:13,000
Don't pretend you don't.

330
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:15,039
I told you to stay out of this.

331
00:21:15,319 --> 00:21:15,839
Did it once.

332
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:16,680
I can do it

333
00:21:16,720 --> 00:21:17,559
again.

334
00:21:19,839 --> 00:21:20,680
What are you doing?

335
00:21:21,279 --> 00:21:21,799
What now?

336
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:23,680
That was way too hard.

337
00:21:24,079 --> 00:21:24,960
One hit with that,

338
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:26,359
you'll answer for it.

339
00:21:26,480 --> 00:21:27,319
Why are you here?

340
00:21:28,599 --> 00:21:29,799
Chaobei Vocational High School

341
00:21:29,799 --> 00:21:31,279
student representative, Ma Na.

342
00:21:32,319 --> 00:21:33,440
So polite.

343
00:21:34,119 --> 00:21:35,240
So kind to everyone.

344
00:21:36,119 --> 00:21:37,039
Is this how you act?

345
00:21:37,279 --> 00:21:38,119
What did I do?

346
00:21:38,759 --> 00:21:39,119
Wait.

347
00:21:39,279 --> 00:21:40,000
I'm talking here.

348
00:21:40,079 --> 00:21:41,079
Why get physical?

349
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:42,119
Then answer me.

350
00:21:45,279 --> 00:21:46,319
How many dads do you have?

351
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:50,079
Every time you screw up,

352
00:21:51,599 --> 00:21:52,759
one fixes it for you?

353
00:21:59,160 --> 00:21:59,680
Leave.

354
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:05,119
- Move. I'm talking to her.
- Leave.

355
00:22:06,519 --> 00:22:07,000
Go.

356
00:22:13,440 --> 00:22:14,400
Watch yourself.

357
00:22:26,799 --> 00:22:27,319
You okay?

358
00:22:31,599 --> 00:22:32,240
Thank you.

359
00:22:36,839 --> 00:22:37,599
I remember you.

360
00:22:38,680 --> 00:22:39,640
Were you following me?

361
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:41,319
I was following her.

362
00:22:47,599 --> 00:22:48,119
Got it.

363
00:22:48,920 --> 00:22:49,640
Okay.

364
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:53,640
Honey.

365
00:22:54,480 --> 00:22:55,960
Bring me two more of those pills.

366
00:22:57,079 --> 00:22:58,279
You just took two.

367
00:22:58,559 --> 00:22:59,559
Don't take more yet.

368
00:23:00,039 --> 00:23:02,000
It's bad for you. What's wrong?

369
00:23:02,519 --> 00:23:04,920
My head feels like it's splitting open.

370
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:08,680
What happened?

371
00:23:10,720 --> 00:23:11,680
Na.

372
00:23:12,599 --> 00:23:13,799
I worked so hard to get her

373
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:15,599
that good-deed award,

374
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:17,319
then the guy went to school

375
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:19,039
and saw her bullying a classmate.

376
00:23:19,480 --> 00:23:21,359
And the guy's a retired cop.

377
00:23:22,079 --> 00:23:23,200
Of course he's suspicious.

378
00:23:25,119 --> 00:23:25,960
Na's back.

379
00:23:29,799 --> 00:23:30,720
Tired, Na?

380
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:32,680
Get changed. Dinner's ready.

381
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:36,319
Isn't this stuff from the old house?

382
00:23:36,519 --> 00:23:37,160
Why is it here?

383
00:23:37,519 --> 00:23:37,960
Yeah.

384
00:23:38,599 --> 00:23:40,200
We rented out the old place.

385
00:23:40,559 --> 00:23:41,279
You rented it out?

386
00:23:41,759 --> 00:23:42,759
Who let you?

387
00:23:43,599 --> 00:23:44,519
Na, what're you after?

388
00:23:44,559 --> 00:23:45,119
Let me help.

389
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:45,720
Go away.

390
00:23:46,119 --> 00:23:47,400
Don't talk to Mei like that.

391
00:23:54,039 --> 00:23:55,880
What are you even looking for?

392
00:23:58,559 --> 00:23:59,480
What are you doing?

393
00:24:03,480 --> 00:24:04,319
You really

394
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:05,880
don't know anything!

395
00:24:10,039 --> 00:24:11,319
What? What's wrong?

396
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:13,119
What're you after?

397
00:24:14,920 --> 00:24:16,480
What's gotten into her?

398
00:24:31,039 --> 00:24:32,880
Thanks for getting me home safe.

399
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:34,920
I'm okay now.

400
00:24:35,079 --> 00:24:35,720
Ting.

401
00:24:38,079 --> 00:24:38,640
Hello, ma'am.

402
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:39,759
Hi.

403
00:24:41,680 --> 00:24:42,240
Who's this?

404
00:24:43,160 --> 00:24:44,839
Jiang Ting,

405
00:24:45,200 --> 00:24:46,400
we'll talk at school.

406
00:24:48,079 --> 00:24:49,559
I'm heading out. Bye, ma'am.

407
00:24:53,039 --> 00:24:55,079
Hi. Let me introduce myself.

408
00:24:55,839 --> 00:24:56,599
I'm Gu Hao.

409
00:24:57,880 --> 00:24:58,920
We've met before.

410
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:01,839
At the school gate.

411
00:25:02,160 --> 00:25:02,559
Right.

412
00:25:02,599 --> 00:25:03,359
You were on a bike.

413
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:03,880
Right.

414
00:25:06,279 --> 00:25:07,359
Here's what's going on.

415
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:09,599
I'm

416
00:25:10,839 --> 00:25:13,240
looking for a missing girl.

417
00:25:14,480 --> 00:25:15,319
She

418
00:25:15,799 --> 00:25:17,359
goes to Jiang Ting's school.

419
00:25:18,279 --> 00:25:18,920
Missing?

420
00:25:19,359 --> 00:25:19,759
Yes.

421
00:25:20,279 --> 00:25:21,240
A student.

422
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:22,519
Her name is Su Lin.

423
00:25:24,359 --> 00:25:25,599
That day at the school gate,

424
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:27,119
(Su Lin)
you said don't know her.

425
00:25:27,599 --> 00:25:28,720
Then why have her clothes?

426
00:25:29,920 --> 00:25:31,160
I don't know her.

427
00:25:32,839 --> 00:25:34,240
Then what's she to you?

428
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:37,400
She's my next-door neighbor.

429
00:25:38,319 --> 00:25:39,240
It's a long story.

430
00:25:39,319 --> 00:25:40,640
A lot of it is hard to explain.

431
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:41,680
But

432
00:25:42,839 --> 00:25:44,240
I have to get involved.

433
00:25:45,279 --> 00:25:46,720
Right now, all I know is

434
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,440
Su Lin's disappearance

435
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:49,640
might involve

436
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:52,440
to do with another student,

437
00:25:52,720 --> 00:25:53,359
Ma Na.

438
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:55,480
And today,

439
00:25:55,960 --> 00:25:57,440
I saw Ma Na almost

440
00:25:58,240 --> 00:25:59,359
hit Jiang Ting.

441
00:26:01,039 --> 00:26:01,960
Jiang Ting's okay.

442
00:26:03,039 --> 00:26:04,359
I happened to see it,

443
00:26:04,599 --> 00:26:05,880
so I brought her home.

444
00:26:07,160 --> 00:26:08,119
Did she hit you?

445
00:26:08,799 --> 00:26:10,160
Ting, answer me.

446
00:26:11,400 --> 00:26:12,039
Ms. Jiang,

447
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:14,680
can I ask Jiang Ting a few questions?

448
00:26:19,039 --> 00:26:19,599
Jiang Ting.

449
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:21,680
Just a guess.

450
00:26:22,640 --> 00:26:23,440
Just guessing.

451
00:26:24,279 --> 00:26:25,759
The way Ma Na treated you today,

452
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:27,759
is it because you know

453
00:26:29,160 --> 00:26:30,240
something about Su Lin?

454
00:26:34,759 --> 00:26:35,519
Do you know

455
00:26:35,559 --> 00:26:37,000
why Su Lin disappeared?

456
00:26:38,119 --> 00:26:39,200
(Eat it!)

457
00:26:39,519 --> 00:26:41,079
(I told you to mind your own business.)

458
00:26:42,119 --> 00:26:43,359
Does Su Lin's disappearance

459
00:26:43,400 --> 00:26:44,559
involve Ma Na?

460
00:26:46,799 --> 00:26:47,720
(What are you doing?)

461
00:26:51,119 --> 00:26:51,839
Don't be scared.

462
00:26:51,880 --> 00:26:53,880
I just want to know about Su Lin.

463
00:26:54,319 --> 00:26:55,480
If you know anything,

464
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:57,119
or saw anything,

465
00:26:57,480 --> 00:26:58,200
heard anything,

466
00:26:58,279 --> 00:26:59,279
you can tell me.

467
00:27:00,839 --> 00:27:01,279
Okay?

468
00:27:03,400 --> 00:27:04,160
I don't know.

469
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:07,480
Ting.

470
00:27:08,480 --> 00:27:09,799
What's going on with you?

471
00:27:09,880 --> 00:27:10,880
Why'd you lock the door?

472
00:27:10,920 --> 00:27:11,920
We have a guest here.

473
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:12,839
That's rude.

474
00:27:12,960 --> 00:27:13,559
Come out.

475
00:27:13,559 --> 00:27:14,759
Whatever it is, we can talk.

476
00:27:14,799 --> 00:27:15,920
Come out. You hear me?

477
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:17,000
Stop asking!

478
00:27:21,480 --> 00:27:22,160
Ms. Jiang.

479
00:27:22,759 --> 00:27:24,000
Maybe I came on too strong.

480
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:25,680
I'm sorry.

481
00:27:31,960 --> 00:27:32,960
How about this?

482
00:27:33,119 --> 00:27:34,680
I'll leave my home number.

483
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:37,480
If Jiang Ting wants to tell me anything,

484
00:27:37,640 --> 00:27:38,720
she can call me.

485
00:27:39,559 --> 00:27:40,039
Okay?

486
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:44,800
(Gu)

487
00:27:48,079 --> 00:27:48,880
I'm sorry.

488
00:27:49,319 --> 00:27:50,240
She's still a kid.

489
00:27:50,599 --> 00:27:51,319
No, it's fine.

490
00:27:52,559 --> 00:27:53,079
Goodbye.

491
00:28:41,300 --> 00:28:43,559
(Chaobei Vocational High School)

492
00:28:43,559 --> 00:28:44,359
Vincent.

493
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:47,759
I don't want to go there.

494
00:28:51,559 --> 00:28:52,359
Like you won't go

495
00:28:52,440 --> 00:28:53,720
to the east-side dump.

496
00:29:24,200 --> 00:29:24,799
Ting.

497
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:31,720
Mom.

498
00:29:34,720 --> 00:29:35,440
I'm hungry.

499
00:29:37,319 --> 00:29:37,960
We have ribs.

500
00:29:39,160 --> 00:29:40,160
I'll heat them up.

501
00:29:55,119 --> 00:29:55,960
Have another bowl.

502
00:29:57,559 --> 00:29:58,079
Here.

503
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:07,039
Ting.

504
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:12,119
Is there something you want to tell me?

505
00:30:14,759 --> 00:30:15,880
I won't tell anyone.

506
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:17,720
I swear.

507
00:30:28,359 --> 00:30:28,880
Mom.

508
00:30:30,799 --> 00:30:31,920
Do you remember

509
00:30:33,519 --> 00:30:34,440
that one day

510
00:30:35,480 --> 00:30:36,480
you said you saw someone

511
00:30:36,480 --> 00:30:38,400
in our school uniform

512
00:30:39,039 --> 00:30:40,319
suddenly disappear?

513
00:30:41,640 --> 00:30:42,920
You thought it was me.

514
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:45,559
That person

515
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:48,920
was Su Lin.

516
00:30:51,079 --> 00:30:51,599
Yes.

517
00:30:53,319 --> 00:30:55,160
Ma Na and two other girls

518
00:30:55,799 --> 00:30:57,200
were by the flower bed out back.

519
00:30:57,640 --> 00:30:58,880
Three against one.

520
00:30:59,440 --> 00:31:00,480
Did they hit you?

521
00:31:02,319 --> 00:31:02,880
No.

522
00:31:04,599 --> 00:31:06,359
They told me to mind my own business.

523
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:07,960
I was so scared.

524
00:31:07,960 --> 00:31:09,200
I ran.

525
00:31:11,559 --> 00:31:13,440
But Su Lin missed school the next day.

526
00:31:14,720 --> 00:31:17,039
Later, I called her house.

527
00:31:17,759 --> 00:31:18,359
(Lin?)

528
00:31:19,440 --> 00:31:20,319
(Is that you?)

529
00:31:21,200 --> 00:31:22,799
It sounded like she never went home.

530
00:31:24,839 --> 00:31:26,880
So I searched by the flower bed

531
00:31:28,359 --> 00:31:29,880
and found a storm drain.

532
00:31:32,880 --> 00:31:34,880
So you went down there?

533
00:31:36,079 --> 00:31:37,000
And that night,

534
00:31:37,279 --> 00:31:38,759
you insisted on going out.

535
00:31:39,319 --> 00:31:41,000
When you rushed back home,

536
00:31:41,200 --> 00:31:42,400
you were filthy.

537
00:31:42,880 --> 00:31:44,279
You were looking for Su Lin?

538
00:31:46,519 --> 00:31:47,440
Oh, honey.

539
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:50,720
Why would she be in a storm drain?

540
00:31:51,359 --> 00:31:52,599
She couldn't be.

541
00:32:07,799 --> 00:32:08,880
Is this Su Lin's?

542
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:14,400
It could be.

543
00:32:27,039 --> 00:32:28,119
Were you close?

544
00:32:31,680 --> 00:32:33,039
She's in Hospitality.

545
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:36,759
We barely ever talked.

546
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:45,559
Then why get involved?

547
00:32:49,359 --> 00:32:51,119
When Su Lin was being beaten,

548
00:32:53,039 --> 00:32:54,319
she looked right at me.

549
00:32:55,359 --> 00:32:56,920
But I was so scared,

550
00:32:57,680 --> 00:32:59,079
I ran.

551
00:32:59,119 --> 00:33:00,599
I did nothing.

552
00:33:04,240 --> 00:33:06,119
If I hadn't left Su Lin there

553
00:33:06,119 --> 00:33:07,279
and run away...

554
00:33:12,279 --> 00:33:14,319
if I'd helped her,

555
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:17,799
maybe things

556
00:33:17,799 --> 00:33:20,240
wouldn't be like this now.

557
00:33:21,400 --> 00:33:24,240
But Su Lin just disappeared.

558
00:33:26,599 --> 00:33:30,799
So I joined Su Lin's recitation team.

559
00:33:31,440 --> 00:33:33,559
I wanted to know what happened to her.

560
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:35,559
But...

561
00:33:35,960 --> 00:33:37,039
(Su Lin just disappeared.)

562
00:33:37,559 --> 00:33:39,519
(Her withdrawal was suspicious.)

563
00:33:41,359 --> 00:33:43,680
I'm not the only one who thinks so.

564
00:33:44,720 --> 00:33:46,839
Something happened to Su Lin.

565
00:33:48,400 --> 00:33:51,200
Mom, I feel awful.

566
00:33:51,960 --> 00:33:53,759
I can't sleep.

567
00:33:54,200 --> 00:33:56,720
I can't focus on school.

568
00:33:58,359 --> 00:34:00,279
I've been running from this.

569
00:34:01,640 --> 00:34:02,359
But

570
00:34:04,319 --> 00:34:06,559
then I met Ma Na on the recitation team.

571
00:34:07,559 --> 00:34:10,920
I finally saw what Su Lin had faced.

572
00:34:12,199 --> 00:34:15,119
It was like stepping into her life.

573
00:34:16,960 --> 00:34:19,440
(Su Lin)
I knew I had to help her.

574
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:23,960
But I'm too weak.

575
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:26,360
Every day,

576
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:28,519
this just keeps eating at me.

577
00:34:29,559 --> 00:34:32,000
I can barely breathe anymore.

578
00:34:34,199 --> 00:34:36,039
Sometimes I look in the mirror

579
00:34:36,920 --> 00:34:39,400
and see Su Lin staring back.

580
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:43,800
How could they do that to her?

581
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:45,239
Mom, you don't understand.

582
00:34:45,800 --> 00:34:47,000
People like them bully others

583
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:48,239
for no reason at all.

584
00:34:48,679 --> 00:34:49,920
Sometimes just because someone

585
00:34:49,920 --> 00:34:51,039
is different from them.

586
00:34:55,559 --> 00:34:56,719
That day,

587
00:34:57,920 --> 00:35:00,039
when they were bullying Su Lin,

588
00:35:02,559 --> 00:35:03,760
she looked at me.

589
00:35:12,400 --> 00:35:14,280
I thought she was asking me for help.

590
00:35:16,159 --> 00:35:17,920
But you know what she said?

591
00:35:22,159 --> 00:35:22,639
(Go!)

592
00:35:23,199 --> 00:35:24,199
(Get out of here!)

593
00:35:30,239 --> 00:35:31,639
While all I could think about

594
00:35:31,679 --> 00:35:33,280
was being scared and running,

595
00:35:34,480 --> 00:35:36,480
she was trying to keep me out of it.

596
00:35:36,599 --> 00:35:37,639
She told me to run.

597
00:35:39,599 --> 00:35:40,519
I just...

598
00:35:40,519 --> 00:35:45,240
♪Darkness spreads like ink♪

599
00:35:45,240 --> 00:35:48,320
Su Lin is an amazing girl.

600
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:51,199
♪Lost eyes search the shadows♪

601
00:35:51,199 --> 00:35:53,519
I've tried to get to know her lately,

602
00:35:53,519 --> 00:35:54,960
♪So many♪

603
00:35:54,960 --> 00:35:56,719
hear stories about her,

604
00:35:57,360 --> 00:35:59,440
read the notes she left in books,

605
00:36:01,079 --> 00:36:02,679
and the things she wrote.

606
00:36:04,679 --> 00:36:05,960
Those words of hers

607
00:36:07,360 --> 00:36:09,920
gave me so much hope and courage.

608
00:36:10,640 --> 00:36:13,400
♪I know that light is salvation♪

609
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:14,960
And later,

610
00:36:15,599 --> 00:36:17,880
