648
00:38:07,760 --> 00:38:09,440
♪Suddenly falls♪

649
00:38:09,440 --> 00:38:13,000
♪Saving all my broken pieces♪

650
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:13,920
So...

651
00:38:17,079 --> 00:38:17,920
