659
00:38:47,960 --> 00:38:48,719
What is it?

660
00:38:53,559 --> 00:38:54,320
Relax.

661
00:38:55,800 --> 00:38:56,960
It's no big deal.

662
00:38:57,280 --> 00:38:58,039
Mr. Gu.

663
00:38:58,440 --> 00:39:00,320
Can we still find her?

664
00:39:02,519 --> 00:39:03,119
Ting.

665
00:39:03,599 --> 00:39:04,559
It's okay. Don't worry.

666
00:39:05,159 --> 00:39:07,800
You found that tiny key.

667
00:39:08,119 --> 00:39:09,239
Su Lin's a whole person.

668
00:39:10,360 --> 00:39:11,400
We'll find her.

669
00:39:32,720 --> 00:39:36,120
♪When a♪

670
00:39:36,120 --> 00:39:40,160
♪Nameless little flower trembles♪

671
00:39:40,160 --> 00:39:44,720
♪And lifts its face to the sun♪

672
00:39:44,720 --> 00:39:49,200
♪In that moment♪

673
00:39:49,200 --> 00:39:53,000
♪I gaze at♪

674
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:57,200
♪Every unfamiliar light♪

675
00:39:57,200 --> 00:40:01,360
♪Only starlight keeps on shining♪

676
00:40:01,360 --> 00:40:05,560
♪Warming me♪

677
00:40:07,440 --> 00:40:09,080
♪Let♪

678
00:40:09,080 --> 00:40:13,680
♪Every laugh and every tear pass by♪

679
00:40:13,680 --> 00:40:17,000
♪Then bloom out of the dust♪

680
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:22,880
♪Like flowers reaching for the sun♪

681
00:40:22,880 --> 00:40:26,600
♪Everyone♪

682
00:40:26,600 --> 00:40:31,680
