685
00:40:40,280 --> 00:40:43,720
♪When the wind blows♪

686
00:40:43,720 --> 00:40:48,040
♪Hear me tell what's in my heart♪

687
00:40:48,040 --> 00:40:52,800
♪Give me a safe, dreamlike♪

688
00:40:52,800 --> 00:40:57,240
♪Little corner♪

689
00:40:57,240 --> 00:41:00,840
♪Go chase it♪

690
00:41:00,840 --> 00:41:05,080
♪Run through the pouring rain♪

691
00:41:05,080 --> 00:41:09,560
♪Clear skies are up ahead♪

692
00:41:09,560 --> 00:41:14,720
♪Waiting for me♪

693
00:41:36,080 --> 00:41:39,240
♪When the sunlight♪

694
00:41:39,240 --> 00:41:43,280
♪Traces every dream in light♪

695
00:41:43,280 --> 00:41:49,120
♪I gently close my hand around that♪

696
00:41:49,120 --> 00:41:54,360
♪Warmth♪
